TEXT -64 -400 Left 2 ;05  OUTPUT SUMMER  (DC sweep of SUM_SIG)\n;U9A OPA1612 inverting summer: OUT_DRV = -(R14/R11) SUM_SIG - (R14/R12) OFF_BUF - (R14/R13) VREF_N\n;= -4.309 SUM_SIG - 3.233 OFF_BUF + 10.772 V.  R15 49.9 ohm -> BNC -> load RL.\n;RL = 1k is the spec load; try RL=1e9 (open) or RL=50 (note: the model has no current limit;\n;the real OPA1612 limits at ~55 mA, so 50 ohm at full swing will clip on the bench).
